{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25377","headline":"奉和圣制南郊礼毕诗 · 李德裕","name":"奉和圣制南郊礼毕诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"磬管歌大吕，冕裘旅天神。\n烧萧辟阊阖，祈谷爲蒸人。\n羽旗洒轻雪，麦陇含阳春。\n昌运岁今会，王猷从此新。\n三臣皆就日，万国望如云。\n仁寿信非远，羣生方在钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}